{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/915535-forum-post-tricks","id":915535,"title":"Forum Post Tricks","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-16T05:37:53-07:00","id":915535,"title":"Forum Post Tricks","content":"Hey everyone,<br /> <br /> I was just wondering, is there a list somewhere the explains how to do some of the cool post tricks that I have seen utilized by others?<br /> <br /> Examples would be the linking to a person's profile that looks like &quot;@name&quot; as a hyperlink. Another cool trick is folks that are quoting multiple quotes that go straight to the post in question.<br /> <br /> Thanks in advance!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Teamwork makes the dream work!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4720-taldorblackfire","name":"Taldorblackfire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4720_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-16T06:11:48-07:00","id":915550,"title":"","content":"To link quotes you just need to have the opening (Quote) with the message link, for example (QUOTE=wyrdhamster;n915544) and (QUOTE=wyrdhamster;n915477) will link back to two separate messages. An easy way to get those would be to just click on the '&quot;Quote' option below their post and copy the (QUOTE=) then abandoning the message. If you want to link to a post without actually quoting, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/915535-forum-post-tricks#post915535\">like so</a>, you can grab the link from the post number in the upper right of the post, highlight the section you want to act as hyperlink, then click on 'Link' in the drop down menu and insert the link there.<br /> <br /> The link to a person's profile, I think, just requires you to spell their name properly and use an 'at sign.' <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4720-taldorblackfire\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4720_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4720\" data-vbnamecard=\"4720\">Taldorblackfire</a> When typing, a little grey box will appear underneath offering you the person's name. Just click on it and it does the rest.<br /> <br /> You can't really upload images, maybe if they're very small. So you generally have to link to existing images. (img)<a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/nJBWrH3.jpg(/img\" target=\"_blank\">http://i.imgur.com/nJBWrH3.jpg(/img</a>). I usually further encase them in (spoiler)(/spoiler) just to reduce spam or may spoil things. Linking to videos is much easier, just click on the Insert Video link and put in the address.<br /> <br /> There's probably a lot of other things you can do but posting images and linking to other posts and websites has really been all I've found I've needed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 06-16-2016, 09:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-16T10:25:55-07:00","id":915695,"title":"","content":"If you want to multi-quote on the same page (I'm not sure why this doesn't work over multiple pages), click the quote button under each post. The Post Reply (X) button in the top left will add one to X for each post you select. You'll only see one quote show up automatically in your response, but if you click the Post Reply button, all of them will show up.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-16T15:41:29-07:00","id":915885,"title":"","content":"Was I quoted/called on? Because I cannot say from post, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar886_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"886\" data-vbnamecard=\"886\">nofather</a>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-16T16:30:06-07:00","id":915916,"title":"","content":"Nah, I was just reading your post about Inferno when I saw this thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-16T17:52:35-07:00","id":915941,"title":"","content":"Anotjer way to tag users with &quot;@username&quot; is to type (user)charlaquin(/user), replacing the parentheses with brackets and charlaquin with the username of whoever you're trying to tag. Just make sure it's spelled correctly.<br /> <br /> These forums use pretty standard html code, so you can do a lot of cool things by manually entering code in brackets. A quick google search for html code tags should be able to find you a few lists of common ones.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}